---
import RedesignLayout from '../../layouts/RedesignLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../../components/band/PageHero.astro';
import RdFeature from '../../components/redesign/RdFeature.astro';
import LeafHeading from '../../components/redesign/LeafHeading.astro';
import RdCta from '../../components/redesign/RdCta.astro';
import VideoEmbed from '../../components/global/VideoEmbed.astro';
import StoryStrip from '../../components/band/StoryStrip.astro';

const gallery = [
  { src: '/images/field/medical-uganda.webp', caption: 'A Favor medical clinic in Uganda' },
  { src: '/images/field/baptism-south-sudan.webp', caption: 'A baptism on the water in South Sudan' },
  { src: '/images/field/church-dedication-uganda.webp', caption: 'A church gathered for dedication in Uganda' },
  { src: '/images/field-2026/church-2.webp', caption: 'Believers gathering where a church was planted' },
];

const programs = [
  { name: 'Medical', href: '/impact/community-development/medical/', image: '/images/field-2026/medical-4.webp', alt: 'Favor medical care in the field', body: 'Favor clinics provide basic medical care in both Uganda and South Sudan, and mobile medical clinics serve those who cannot come to our medical centers. In our medical centers, we pray with each of our patients.' },
  { name: 'Church Planting', href: '/impact/community-development/church-planting/', image: '/images/field-2026/church-7.webp', alt: 'A church gathered for dedication', body: 'In many rural communities there are no churches, so following a Portable Bible School small churches are planted, sometimes meeting in a hut or under a mango tree. Thousands of churches have been planted across Uganda and South Sudan.' },
  { name: 'Church Construction', href: '/impact/community-development/construction/', image: '/images/field-2026/construction-3.webp', alt: 'A church construction project underway', body: 'Favor partners with International Cooperating Ministries (ICM) to fund new church construction. These churches don’t belong to Favor but to the community of believers and their leadership from that local church.' },
];
---
<RedesignLayout
  title="Community Development"
  description="Trauma counseling, medical services, and church planting: Favor International's community development pillar."
>
  <PageHero
    label="What we do"
    title="Community Development."
    promise="Trauma counseling, medical services, and church planting in places no other ministry will go."
    image="/images/pillar-community-care.jpg"
    imageAlt="Field medical care in South Sudan"
    ctaLabel="Fund a clinic"
    ctaHref="/give/specific-project/"
  />

  <section class="band band--white">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="video-feature">
        <div class="video-feature__copy">
          <p class="label">From the field</p>
          <h2>Where medicine meets miracles.</h2>
          <p>Medical care, church planting, and trauma healing reach places no other ministry will go. Watch the work, then read how each program runs.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="video-feature__player">
          <VideoEmbed id="4YpOvDoc6k4" title="Where Medicine Meets Miracles" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <RdFeature
    image="/images/field-2026/church-3.webp"
    imageAlt="A church dedication in the field"
    eyebrow="Transforming communities"
    heading="The whole community, transformed."
    side="left"
    background="white"
  >
    <p>Favor's community development model has been informed by almost 20 years of work and recognizes the church as the hub of the community and the Word of God as center of sustainable, ongoing community development. Full community development includes a crusade, discipleship, trauma healing, a Portable Bible School, a church building, women's empowerment, a village learning center, a well, and mobile medical clinics. Community development starts with nothing less than transformed lives surrendered to Jesus and then extends to holistic transformation of the entire community.</p>
    <p>We could comfort those in emotional pain. We could bandage every wound. We could build beautiful buildings. We could even pass out thousands of Bibles, but if not one heart is baptized in the love of Christ, then we have not accomplished what we came to do. Our foremost mission is guiding hearts to Jesus, but we also recognize that without a demonstration of God's love in meeting people where they are at emotionally, physically, and spiritually, as Jesus did, the former won't happen.</p>
  </RdFeature>

  <section class="band band--cream">
    <div class="container">
      <LeafHeading label="Holistic transformation by the Word" title="Bringing healing to the whole person." intro="Care meets immediate needs while the local church and trained community leaders carry restoration forward." />
      <div class="cd-grid">
        {programs.map((p) => (
          <a class="cd-card cd-card--link" href={p.href}>
            <span class="cd-card__photo" style={`background-image:url(${p.image})`} role="img" aria-label={p.alt}></span>
            <span class="cd-card__body">
              <h3>{p.name}</h3>
              <p>{p.body}</p>
              <span class="cd-card__more">Learn more &rarr;</span>
            </span>
          </a>
        ))}
      </div>
      <p class="cd-cta-row"><a class="btn btn--secondary btn--large" href="/stories/">See field stories</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <RdFeature
    image="/images/hero-trauma-counseling.jpg"
    imageAlt="A trauma counseling session in the field"
    eyebrow="Trauma counseling"
    heading="Healing the whole person."
    side="left"
  >
    <p>Our trauma healing program has two parts. The first section focuses on developing emotional strength, and the second teaches about forgiveness. Throughout the program, the counselors teach people how to connect to one another and counter stress with positive activity.</p>
    <p>The original Trauma Counseling curriculum that we use was <strong>written by Christ-believing psychologists from Australia, peer-reviewed through publications at Boston University</strong>, and for many years has been adapted and contextualized for the many people groups we serve throughout South Sudan and Uganda.</p>
    <p><a href="/impact/community-development/counseling/">Read about Trauma Counseling &rarr;</a></p>
  </RdFeature>

  <section class="band band--white">
    <div class="container">
      <LeafHeading label="From the field" title="Healing, planting, baptizing." />
      <div class="field-gallery">
        {gallery.map((g) => (
          <figure class="field-tile" style={`background-image:url(${g.src})`} role="img" aria-label={g.caption}>
            <figcaption>{g.caption}</figcaption>
          </figure>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <StoryStrip tags={['Emotional Healing', 'Physical Healing', 'Community Transformation']} heading="Stories of healing." background="cream" />

  <RdCta
    heading="Help carry the cost of healing."
    body="Trauma counseling, medical clinics, and church planting are field-led. Favor Partners keep them funded."
    ctaLabel="Become a Favor Partner"
    ctaHref="/give/partner-monthly/"
    image="/images/field-2026/medical-2.webp"
    imageAlt="A Favor community gathering"
  />
</RedesignLayout>

<style>
  .cd-head { text-align: center; max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto var(--space-12); }
  .cd-intro { max-width: 760px; }
  .cd-intro .cd-head { margin-bottom: var(--space-8); }
  .cd-intro p { color: var(--color-ink-soft); line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 0 var(--space-5); }
  .cd-intro p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .cd-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: var(--space-6); }
  @media (max-width: 860px) { .cd-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  .cd-card { background: var(--color-white); border-radius: var(--radius-card); overflow: hidden; box-shadow: var(--shadow-card); display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
  .cd-card__photo { display: block; aspect-ratio: 16 / 10; background-size: cover; background-position: center 30%; }
  .cd-card__body { display: block; padding: var(--space-6); }
  .cd-card h3 { margin: 0 0 var(--space-3); color: var(--color-green); font-size: 1.25rem; text-align: center; }
  .cd-card__more { display: block; text-align: center; }
  .cd-card p { margin: 0; color: var(--color-ink-soft); line-height: 1.65; }
  .cd-card--link { text-decoration: none; color: inherit; display: block; transition: transform 180ms, box-shadow 180ms; }
  .cd-card--link:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); box-shadow: 0 18px 40px rgba(31, 58, 26, 0.15); }
  .cd-card__more { display: inline-block; margin-top: var(--space-4); color: var(--color-gold-deep); font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.9rem; }
  .cd-card--link:hover .cd-card__more { color: var(--color-green); }
  .cd-cta-row { text-align: center; margin-top: var(--space-16); }
</style>
